;; 20-actors/itonami/schema.edn — Datomic/Datascript compatible schema for
;; 20-actors/itonami/data/*.kotoba.edn tx-data (per repo-wide edn-datomize pass,
;; port of manifest/edn-datomize.cljs classify/schema-attrs; manual accumulation
;; since this actor's data files are multi-entity vectors, not single wrapped
;; maps, so wrap-map! wasn't applicable as-is).
;; :db/ident attribute definitions. No Datomic-specific keys (no
;; :db.install/_attribute etc). Hand-maintained — extend when a new attribute
;; namespace/key is added to 20-actors/itonami/data/*.kotoba.edn.
[
 {:db/ident :detect/class :db/valueType :db.type/keyword :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one}
 {:db/ident :detect/conf :db/valueType :db.type/double :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one}
